abstract: >-
  A Python package and a Lean 4 library. Version 1 implements the verifier-gated VSI circuit:
  typed conjecture packages, obligation graphs and a release algebra in which a result is
  released only when every verifier factor is 1. Version 2 adds the BLLM system: entropy-law
  check schedules, a typed crossing network of known constructions with a program check and a
  refuter for every candidate, booster weights, a shared memory with retrieval, target points,
  an attack channel, five target agents and a continuous loop, tested on five open problems
  (none solved), with the logs of every run.
